  "system": {
    "description": "<section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block scrpg-archetype-block-intro\"><p>You are not from Earth, though your powers might not be all that unusual where you come from. Or you've been granted abilities by an extraterrestrial source.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Powers</div><p>Assign all the dice you rolled at the end of the background step to any of the following powers:</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.hQIArnjTuOBxYoPT]{Signature Vehicle}</p><p>• @UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.powers.Item.fubw8CJu2mXFZJUD]{Signature Weaponry}</p><p>• Select from Athletic powers category</p><p>• Select from Elemental/Energy powers category</p><p>• Select from Intellectual powers category</p><p>• Select from Mobility powers category</p><p>• Select from Psychic powers category</p><p>• Select from Technological powers category</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Abilities</div><p>Gain two of these Yellow abilities, each using a different power:</p><ul class=\"scrpg-archetype-ability-links\"><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.ZrzTIq5ydzzAGpCe]{Alien Boost}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.g4uHfCTG6ZwW3ykX]{Empower and Repair}</li><li>@UUID[Compendium.scrpg-actor-compendium.abilities.Item.4Vx0kglZMKYV7jem]{Halt}</li></ul></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Additional Info</div><p>Then, upgrade one d8 power or quality to d10. If you have no d8 powers, instead add a new power from the above list at d8.</p></section><section class=\"scrpg-archetype-block\"><div class=\"scrpg-archetype-section\">Archetype</div><p>Roll d8, d8, d8 for archetype selection.</p></section>"
